ther.","source":"BTS 3 · #63","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/155dffb8-b618-4a5b-843f-2235c5f51070.webp","imageBytes":26292},"77673e886b1b":{"id":"77673e886b1b","text":"We have a bookshelf.","source":"BTS 6 · #71","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/6d466005-d40c-44d2-b270-4812ec6db662.webp","imageBytes":18288},"08e13298a3b9":{"id":"08e13298a3b9","text":"Frogs live near ponds and lakes.","source":"BTS 26 · #90","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/c388d2ff-1930-4910-8ba5-e453cafdf486.webp","imageBytes":22346},"af567bab75ce":{"id":"af567bab75ce","text":"The curtains are red.","source":"BTS 6 · #76","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/b82eab4f-d4d6-40ca-ad7e-63ab0498d441.webp","imageBytes":18702},"df48c602d535":{"id":"df48c602d535","text":"Gloves keep your hands warm in winter.","source":"BTS 27 · #96","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/c5ac5fab-a9e6-4bb9-9a37-9512779b3e09.webp","imageBytes":22762},"875192ed1e19":{"id":"875192ed1e19","text":"Sunglasses protect our eyes from bright sunlight.","source":"BTS 27 · #48","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/f287c306-1811-4f4c-8df9-aa1b66a105e2.webp","imageBytes":10300},"c8a4657cb26e":{"id":"c8a4657cb26e","text":"Yes, lamps symbolize the victory of good.","source":"BTS 21 · #48","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/2cacf79a-fd12-4ff1-bb60-97686f6ac501.webp","imageBytes":5814},"ad87eff2dbc9":{"id":"ad87eff2dbc9","text":"She showed the parliamentary committee overwhelming evidence that the existing welfare system failed to provide adequate support for the most economically marginalized populations.","source":"SIU Advance 1 · #32","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/906b4b2d-2d9d-